.idea
bin/
# but NOT Rust's src/bin/ convention (cargo binary sources live there).
# `!src/bin/` is depth-anchored (slash-in-middle → relative to THIS .gitignore's
# dir only); `!**/src/bin/` matches at any depth. The depth-anchored form left
# rust/xfusion-recomp/src/bin/sweep.rs silently never-tracked for a full session
# (every commit that named it in the message included zero bytes of it).
!**/src/bin/
obj/
*.DotSettings.user
*.log
*.partial
node_modules/

# House-vocab pattern lists: the gate's own patterns ARE house-vocab by
# construction, so a pattern file in a PUBLIC repo publishes the thing it
# exists to keep out. Path-anchoring one of these is the bug -- a sibling
# copy written by any script slips through. Match the NAME, anywhere.
.vocab-patterns.txt
.vocab-gate.txt
*/.vocab-gate.txt
**/.vocab-gate.txt
oracle-baseline/.vocab-patterns.txt
